From db2e61d5015d27fba1a016878cd895dcfb9752c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 10/20] a deterministic re-org barrier and the transport fixes
 around it

The release is measured from the candidate (36 blocks past the fork) so
every node switches on the same block; the refusal stays local. Shunko now
requires a hidden-service target, and the perticket path bounds and
rate-limits before it spends RandomX.
---
