         // then re-check under lock (the tip may have moved while hashing). Valid, new
         // tickets are pooled and relayed onward (see per.h).
+        // Bound the size before deserialising, not after. The payout is a CScript
+        // whose CompactSize length comes straight from the peer, so deserialising
