+                // Relay-only nodes never template or mine, so nothing else sweeps for
+                // them and stale tickets would wedge the pool for good. Sweeping copies
+                // the whole pool and does a block index lookup per entry under cs_main,
+                // so doing it on every message let one peer hold cs_main down over and
